WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 20]

01:49.239 --> 01:50.499
Rebuild the latrine?

01:50.519 --> 01:51.499
Yes.

01:51.519 --> 01:53.139
It's Mr. Fan's idea again.

01:53.159 --> 01:55.720
Mr. Guo, this is indeed baffling.

01:57.310 --> 01:58.930
Tell him we are short of manpower.

01:58.950 --> 02:00.360
It can't be done in time.

02:00.480 --> 02:02.460
He arranged manpower
from the First Division.

02:02.480 --> 02:03.919
He didn't ask for our men.

02:04.200 --> 02:05.800
The exam hall is off-limits.

02:05.879 --> 02:06.980
No one is allowed inside.

02:07.000 --> 02:09.499
Mr. Guo, the Imperial Inspectorate
has the authority to monitor anyone.

02:09.519 --> 02:10.539
As per the rules,

02:10.559 --> 02:13.000
they are also entitled
to arrest the candidates.

02:17.600 --> 02:19.320
Then why are you telling me that?

02:19.640 --> 02:23.950
He requests you allocate the logs and bricks
from the Ministry of Rites' warehouse.

02:25.320 --> 02:26.542
Those are Phoebe Zhennan logs

02:26.562 --> 02:27.602
and kiln bricks!

02:27.610 --> 02:29.030
He wants to use them
to build mere latrines?

02:29.040 --> 02:30.320
He knows

02:30.920 --> 02:32.600
this seems ridiculous,

02:32.760 --> 02:34.079
but...

02:34.519 --> 02:35.639
What?

02:35.959 --> 02:38.270
But the spring exam is held
by the Ministry of Rites.

02:38.360 --> 02:40.079
He will offer manpower,

02:40.600 --> 02:41.320
but the materials

02:41.320 --> 02:42.740
must be supplied
by the Ministry of Rites.

02:42.760 --> 02:43.519
That way,

02:43.519 --> 02:45.180
it's legal and not against the rules.

02:45.200 --> 02:46.320
Scratch that.

02:52.920 --> 02:54.000
Rules.

02:54.360 --> 02:55.440
Right.

02:57.679 --> 02:59.239
We should follow the rules.

03:04.519 --> 03:05.599
Mr. Fan.

03:08.080 --> 03:10.900
Deng and the rest have fixed the latrines.

03:10.920 --> 03:13.039
It won't affect the spring exam.

03:13.600 --> 03:14.840
Good job.

03:16.840 --> 03:19.000
I still get the jitters
when I think about it now.

03:19.839 --> 03:22.079
Just how snide they are

03:22.239 --> 03:24.780
to put kerosene in the latrines.

03:24.800 --> 03:26.180
If candidates bring a candle in

03:26.200 --> 03:28.379
after dark,

03:28.399 --> 03:29.699
a small careless move

03:29.719 --> 03:31.799
could cause a big fire.

03:34.559 --> 03:35.720
Wang,

03:36.439 --> 03:37.880
for your information,

03:38.600 --> 03:39.820
in a place like that,

03:39.840 --> 03:41.219
not only would it catch fire,

03:41.239 --> 03:42.180
but it could also explode.

03:42.200 --> 03:43.280
Explode?

03:44.119 --> 03:46.479
If the latrines were to explode,

03:46.519 --> 03:47.599
I'm afraid

03:47.760 --> 03:50.239
this would leave a dark chapter

03:50.519 --> 03:52.959
in the history books.

03:53.439 --> 03:56.160
"On that fateful day,

03:56.559 --> 03:59.379
during the spring exam
hosted by Mr. Fan Xian,

03:59.399 --> 04:01.440
numerous candidates
lost their lives in..."

04:02.839 --> 04:04.840
How shameful.

04:05.239 --> 04:06.519
Three more days to come.

04:08.719 --> 04:09.780
Come what may,

04:09.800 --> 04:11.020
I will keep them safe.

04:11.040 --> 04:11.780
I value

04:11.800 --> 04:13.450
their lives,

04:13.470 --> 04:15.110
even if those officials don't.

04:15.559 --> 04:16.890
I will protect them,

04:16.910 --> 04:18.390
even if those officials don't.

04:22.600 --> 04:23.680
It's a shame.

04:24.079 --> 04:26.480
They know nothing

04:26.759 --> 04:28.920
about what you have done for them.

04:43.990 --> 04:46.299
I don't seek recognition
for the good deeds I have done.

04:46.319 --> 04:48.240
Please call me
the Red Scarf Young Pioneer.

04:48.999 --> 04:51.839
Wait, Mr. Fan. What did you just say?

04:52.679 --> 04:54.599
Red Scarf Young Pioneer.

05:07.960 --> 05:10.079
They replace the candles
and drinking water

05:10.160 --> 05:12.079
as well as rebuild the latrines.

05:12.679 --> 05:14.759
Mr. Guo bought off several candidates

05:14.800 --> 05:17.800
to try to frame Fan Xian
in the next three days.

05:19.239 --> 05:20.320
No need for that.

05:20.879 --> 05:21.859
No need?

05:21.879 --> 05:23.219
No accidents would be more effective

05:23.239 --> 05:24.790
than poisoned water and fire.

05:25.239 --> 05:26.719
Fan Xian won't be brought down

05:26.800 --> 05:28.410
unless

05:28.430 --> 05:29.880
there are dozens of deaths.

05:30.840 --> 05:32.740
At least, we should
give him some warning.

05:32.920 --> 05:33.960
Why waste the effort

05:33.960 --> 05:35.560
if we can't take him down in one blow?

05:35.600 --> 05:37.240
Tell Guo Zheng to stop.

05:38.920 --> 05:40.719
It should've been a great chance.

05:43.759 --> 05:46.159
Something is amiss.

05:46.559 --> 05:47.659
Guo Zheng is so devious

05:47.679 --> 05:50.519
that I too might fall prey to his trap.

05:51.360 --> 05:53.040
Fan Xian is cunning.

05:54.600 --> 05:55.680
No.

05:56.439 --> 05:58.399
Only experienced officials

05:58.480 --> 05:59.719
with years of service

06:00.040 --> 06:01.520
in the Ministry of Rites

06:01.520 --> 06:03.299
would discern such minor problems.

06:03.319 --> 06:06.159
Not everyone would pay attention
to candles and drinking water.

06:06.840 --> 06:08.570
Someone in the ministry helped him.

06:15.119 --> 06:16.599
Who could it be?

08:56.079 --> 08:56.980
Someone fainted.

08:57.000 --> 08:58.240
What has happened?

08:59.719 --> 09:00.799
Come.

09:08.359 --> 09:09.439
Uh...

09:18.959 --> 09:21.479
Submit your papers!

09:24.719 --> 09:26.299
Mr. Fan is

09:26.319 --> 09:27.620
indeed meticulous.

09:27.640 --> 09:29.760
Even the Imperial Inspectorate
helped us out.

09:30.400 --> 09:32.459
The past three days have been perfect

09:32.479 --> 09:33.339
without accidents.

09:33.359 --> 09:34.819
Congratulations.

09:34.839 --> 09:36.999
I have always had faith in Mr. Fan.

09:37.319 --> 09:40.059
Mr. Guo, you have keen eyes.

09:40.079 --> 09:41.459
You are

09:41.479 --> 09:43.620
a gratifying godsend

09:43.640 --> 09:46.040
for the Ministry of Rites.

09:48.840 --> 09:50.760
Have all the answer sheets
been collected?

09:50.850 --> 09:52.270
Everything goes smoothly.

09:52.520 --> 09:54.920
Next will
be the anonymous transcription.

09:54.960 --> 09:56.380
There won't be any untoward accidents.

09:56.400 --> 09:58.400
Please rest assured, Mr. Guo.

10:38.199 --> 10:39.359
Mr. Fan.

10:40.640 --> 10:42.800
You have had tough days.

10:42.839 --> 10:44.620
Why don't you return home and rest?

10:44.640 --> 10:45.839
That won't do.

10:46.160 --> 10:48.520
I need to supervise
the anonymous transcription.

10:48.679 --> 10:51.190
I mustn't slack off
on the task entrusted by His Majesty.

10:51.800 --> 10:53.480
You are capable and reassuring.

10:54.359 --> 10:56.320
So, this is the anonymous procedure?

10:56.880 --> 10:57.780
Right.

10:57.800 --> 10:58.980
Cover the candidates' names

10:59.000 --> 11:00.839
to ensure a just grading.

11:01.400 --> 11:03.560
Over there is the transcription.

11:03.599 --> 11:06.220
Each answer sheet will be transcribed.

11:06.240 --> 11:08.819
After all, handwriting

11:08.839 --> 11:10.640
might expose one's identity.

11:12.270 --> 11:13.520
How considerate.

11:15.479 --> 11:18.160
After that, the transcription copies
will be sent for grading.

11:18.439 --> 11:20.560
Talent is the only criterion
for judgment.

11:30.599 --> 11:32.400
What should I do

11:32.599 --> 11:33.839
if I want to cheat?

11:38.280 --> 11:39.760
Mr. Fan,

11:40.240 --> 11:41.520
I beg your pardon.

11:41.679 --> 11:43.160
I was saying,

11:43.319 --> 11:45.900
if I want to cheat
during the anonymous transcription

11:45.920 --> 11:47.320
what should I do?

11:49.520 --> 11:50.380
Mr. Fan,

11:50.400 --> 11:51.819
please don't joke about that.

11:51.839 --> 11:52.860
I won't do that.

11:52.880 --> 11:54.239
I'm just curious.

11:54.719 --> 11:56.760
There is no such thing.

11:58.350 --> 12:00.020
I'm not saying
that it happens right now.

12:00.040 --> 12:01.620
It has never happened before.

12:01.640 --> 12:03.100
You don't trust me.

12:03.120 --> 12:04.599
I'm telling the truth.

12:05.500 --> 12:07.559
I heard that paper straps used
to cover the candidates' names

12:07.559 --> 12:08.999
are different in length.

12:14.439 --> 12:16.400
Different lengths

12:17.400 --> 12:18.800
are also a mark.

12:19.470 --> 12:21.430
The transcription area
is over there, right?

12:33.280 --> 12:34.479
As for the transcription,

12:34.479 --> 12:36.740
someone might leave
an inkprint on the answer sheet

12:36.760 --> 12:39.059
to hint

12:39.079 --> 12:40.839
the examiner.

12:41.719 --> 12:43.260
There is no such thing.

12:43.280 --> 12:45.740
Where did you hear about this?

12:45.760 --> 12:47.160
Just rumors.

12:50.079 --> 12:51.220
Of course,

12:51.240 --> 12:53.280
I believe no one here

12:53.839 --> 12:55.560
would do such a thing.

12:59.319 --> 13:00.520
After all,

13:00.959 --> 13:03.239
no one wants to die.

13:12.120 --> 13:13.339
I was just kidding.

13:13.359 --> 13:14.699
Please focus on your work.

13:14.719 --> 13:16.040
I will observe and learn.

14:07.325 --> 14:09.270
[Admitted]

14:21.440 --> 14:22.620
Guo Zheng sends a message.

14:22.640 --> 14:24.900
Fan Xian is aware of the tricks
the Ministry of Rites used.

14:24.920 --> 14:27.419
He wanted to help your retainers,

14:27.439 --> 14:29.719
but it wasn't quite convenient.

14:30.520 --> 14:31.959
What retainers?

14:33.199 --> 14:34.839
I don't have retainers.

14:37.719 --> 14:38.799
Understood.

14:38.840 --> 14:40.100
They are only candidates,

14:40.120 --> 14:41.239
not retainers.

14:41.599 --> 14:42.879
It's a good thing

14:43.000 --> 14:45.239
for the spring exam to be clean.

14:45.920 --> 14:47.359
No need to intervene.

14:47.640 --> 14:49.280
They are on their own.

14:49.920 --> 14:51.800
I will relay this to Guo Zheng.

15:37.525 --> 15:41.545
[Yang Wanli]

15:51.559 --> 15:52.470
Shi, Yang.

15:52.490 --> 15:53.800
Why are you up so early?

15:54.079 --> 15:54.860
It's my habit.

15:54.880 --> 15:56.640
I always wake up around the same time.

15:57.120 --> 15:58.059
Shi,

15:58.079 --> 15:59.059
the exam is over.

15:59.079 --> 16:00.359
Why are you reading?

16:05.000 --> 16:06.119
Hou,

16:06.199 --> 16:07.270
look at this.

16:07.290 --> 16:08.419
I couldn't recall this sentence

16:08.439 --> 16:09.780
during the exam.

16:09.800 --> 16:10.500
Well,

16:10.520 --> 16:11.330
the exam is over.

16:11.350 --> 16:12.720
Stop thinking about it.

16:14.200 --> 16:15.479
Where is Cheng Jialin?

16:15.719 --> 16:17.059
The three-day exam has worn him out.

16:17.079 --> 16:18.339
I couldn't wake him up.

16:18.359 --> 16:19.059
Right.

16:19.079 --> 16:21.220
I felt like a different person
after three days.

16:21.240 --> 16:22.359
Exactly.

16:27.120 --> 16:27.740
Shi,

16:27.760 --> 16:28.900
you are acting weirdly.

16:28.920 --> 16:30.459
Hou, what is that smell?

16:30.479 --> 16:31.719
You smell great.

16:31.839 --> 16:33.220
You have a sensitive nose.

16:33.240 --> 16:34.079
Is it food again?

16:34.079 --> 16:34.860
Of course.

16:34.880 --> 16:36.339
You are so considerate, Hou...

16:36.359 --> 16:37.479
It's chicken!

16:37.920 --> 16:38.970
Roasted chicken.

16:38.990 --> 16:40.140
Where did you get this?

16:40.160 --> 16:41.419
I prepared this last night

16:41.439 --> 16:43.500
and wanted to celebrate after the exam.

16:43.520 --> 16:45.659
But the three of you slept like a log.

16:45.679 --> 16:48.300
Hou, I really appreciate you
for feeding me for the past few days.

16:48.320 --> 16:50.500
Eat this chicken to our heart's content,
there will be more to come.

16:50.520 --> 16:50.880
Hou,

16:50.880 --> 16:52.999
you can't use Mr. Fan's poem
in that way.

16:53.040 --> 16:54.199
Well, let's eat up

16:54.199 --> 16:55.359
before it turns bad.

16:56.600 --> 16:58.120
I will divide the chicken up.

17:07.240 --> 17:08.359
I can't believe

17:09.159 --> 17:10.940
we were wined and dined

17:10.960 --> 17:12.299
by Mr. Fan that night.

17:12.319 --> 17:13.800
I was surprised too.

17:13.919 --> 17:15.740
Who would've thought that?

17:15.760 --> 17:16.119
Exactly.

17:16.119 --> 17:18.280
I was shocked when I found out.

17:18.560 --> 17:20.420
Speaking of which,
it scared me out of my wits

17:20.440 --> 17:22.299
when he found a crib sheet

17:22.319 --> 17:24.079
from the vegetable pancake.

17:24.200 --> 17:26.079
Thankfully, he proved my innocence.

17:26.240 --> 17:27.280
Should the four of us

17:27.280 --> 17:29.399
pay him a visit?

17:30.399 --> 17:31.560
- Why?
- Why?

17:31.639 --> 17:32.890
Judging from the rumors,

17:32.910 --> 17:33.700
people have mistaken

17:33.720 --> 17:35.440
the four of us

17:35.440 --> 17:36.819
for Mr. Fan's disciples.

17:36.839 --> 17:38.220
But we know

17:38.240 --> 17:40.000
we are not.

17:40.079 --> 17:41.679
Why don't we

17:41.760 --> 17:43.079
encourage this rumor?

17:44.119 --> 17:45.520
Are you suggesting

17:46.010 --> 17:47.539
that we seek an apprenticeship from him?

17:47.559 --> 17:48.800
Mr. Fan's knowledge

17:48.800 --> 17:50.619
is more than enough to teach us.

17:50.639 --> 17:52.780
If he can be our mentor,

17:52.800 --> 17:53.619
that's wonderful.

17:53.639 --> 17:54.700
Of course.

17:54.720 --> 17:56.040
But if we visit him now,

17:56.320 --> 17:58.079
it seems like we are using shortcuts.

17:59.399 --> 18:00.560
He's right.

18:01.320 --> 18:03.500
Why fear slanted shadows
when you stand upright?

18:03.520 --> 18:04.500
He's right.

18:04.520 --> 18:06.679
We will stand upright,
and so will our shadows.

18:09.200 --> 18:11.079
We can visit Mr. Fan.

18:13.200 --> 18:14.399
But not now.

18:14.480 --> 18:15.560
When?

18:16.159 --> 18:17.339
It's better to meet him

18:17.359 --> 18:18.460
after the results are announced

18:18.480 --> 18:20.599
and everything has settled down.

18:20.680 --> 18:21.760
But...

18:22.319 --> 18:23.520
He made a point.

18:25.520 --> 18:26.839
That's what I thought.

18:28.760 --> 18:30.119
Leave some for Jialin.

18:31.240 --> 18:32.040
I'm Cheng Jialin.

18:32.040 --> 18:33.160
Get lost.

18:34.800 --> 18:36.520
I wonder

18:37.000 --> 18:38.480
what Mr. Fan is doing now.

18:45.559 --> 18:47.619
Mr. Fan, you haven't returned home
for several days and nights.

18:47.639 --> 18:49.379
Your family must miss you.

18:49.399 --> 18:50.919
I can't go home yet.

18:51.839 --> 18:53.780
I need to keep an eye on the grading.

18:53.800 --> 18:55.850
If we want a clean exam,
we should put in some effort.

18:55.870 --> 18:57.879
Everything has been done by now,
hasn't it?

18:58.639 --> 19:00.119
After days of grading,

19:00.119 --> 19:01.820
we are now waiting
for the results to be announced.

19:01.839 --> 19:02.520
I can safely say

19:02.530 --> 19:03.940
that the current spring exam

19:03.960 --> 19:06.180
is clean and just.

19:06.200 --> 19:08.480
How about the four candidates
from Tongfu Inn?

19:09.639 --> 19:11.159
Shi Chanli failed.

19:11.879 --> 19:12.800
Why didn't you help him?

19:12.800 --> 19:14.270
As long as there is fairness.

19:15.200 --> 19:16.760
How about the other three?

19:17.319 --> 19:18.500
Barring any accidents,

19:18.520 --> 19:20.399
they should be admitted,

19:20.879 --> 19:22.139
especially Yang Wanli.

19:22.159 --> 19:23.359
He wrote a good essay.

19:23.919 --> 19:25.299
Mr. Fan, you have

19:25.319 --> 19:26.440
an excellent assessment of people.

19:26.450 --> 19:27.660
Out of the four candidates you met,

19:27.680 --> 19:29.240
three of them succeeded.

19:29.359 --> 19:30.700
Had I known this earlier,

19:30.720 --> 19:33.180
I might've given it a try too.

19:33.200 --> 19:35.740
Maybe I could borrow your luck

19:35.760 --> 19:37.040
and make it through...

19:39.319 --> 19:41.960
Well, sleep tight.

19:46.125 --> 19:54.525
[Fan's Residence]

20:12.119 --> 20:12.859
Deng,

20:12.879 --> 20:15.760
could you please make a noise
when you come in?

20:17.960 --> 20:18.899
Qinian,

20:18.919 --> 20:20.200
what are these?

20:21.040 --> 20:24.359
Mr. Fan's meal.

20:25.440 --> 20:27.119
Qinian,

20:27.280 --> 20:28.800
what are you doing?

20:29.240 --> 20:30.420
This meat,

20:30.440 --> 20:31.639
as you know,

20:32.000 --> 20:35.560
is my Baba's favorite.

20:37.440 --> 20:38.539
I see.

20:38.559 --> 20:41.639
You are stealing Mr. Fan's meat.

20:42.079 --> 20:44.339
Wait, how could you say I stole it?

20:44.359 --> 20:46.940
You see, Mr. Fan is resting.

20:46.960 --> 20:48.460
He doesn't eat the dishes.

20:48.480 --> 20:49.619
We can't let these dishes

20:49.639 --> 20:51.020
be wasted, right?

20:51.040 --> 20:53.199
Still, you can't do that.

20:53.219 --> 20:54.299
Well,

20:54.359 --> 20:56.200
if no one finishes them,

20:56.760 --> 20:58.099
they will be thrown away.

20:58.119 --> 20:59.639
Isn't that a waste?

21:01.000 --> 21:01.399
But...

21:01.399 --> 21:03.800
Wasting food is not good, right?

21:04.359 --> 21:05.220
Right.

21:05.240 --> 21:06.180
So, is there a problem

21:06.200 --> 21:07.960
with what I'm doing?

21:08.520 --> 21:10.059
Qinian, you confused me.

21:10.079 --> 21:10.460
Uh...

21:10.480 --> 21:12.859
There is no way I can tell right
from wrong on this matter.

21:12.879 --> 21:14.099
Well, enough of that.

21:14.119 --> 21:15.879
Have a seat.

21:16.040 --> 21:16.960
Let's eat together.

21:16.960 --> 21:18.320
Don't be shy, all right?

21:18.430 --> 21:19.520
How about this?

21:19.559 --> 21:21.240
I will treat you

21:21.319 --> 21:23.980
to Mr. Fan's meal.

21:24.000 --> 21:25.119
Here you go.

21:28.319 --> 21:29.500
Try it.

21:29.520 --> 21:30.579
As for this meat,

21:30.599 --> 21:31.859
I will keep it for my daughter.

21:31.879 --> 21:34.200
Let's eat

21:34.399 --> 21:35.539
this troublesome

21:35.559 --> 21:36.960
bony fish.

21:37.040 --> 21:38.020
Here.

21:38.040 --> 21:41.579
It's you who asks me to eat.

21:41.599 --> 21:42.720
Right, it's me.

21:42.720 --> 21:44.760
Here. Try the fish eye.

21:45.079 --> 21:47.500
Your eyes get strained
from reading documents.

21:47.520 --> 21:48.599
This is good for your eyes.

21:48.599 --> 21:49.679
Sure.

21:50.559 --> 21:51.339
You are right.

21:51.359 --> 21:52.679
Let me taste it.

21:53.200 --> 21:54.280
How is it?

21:57.639 --> 21:58.719
Fresh.

21:59.079 --> 21:59.819
Is it nice?

21:59.839 --> 22:00.619
Very nice.

22:00.639 --> 22:02.099
Of course.

22:02.119 --> 22:03.220
Look at me.

22:03.240 --> 22:04.839
I have put on much weight.

22:06.960 --> 22:08.839
Taste this too.

22:08.960 --> 22:10.040
Qinian,

22:10.559 --> 22:11.899
how much longer

22:11.919 --> 22:13.839
will Mr. Fan sleep?

22:14.040 --> 22:15.020
What's the matter?

22:15.040 --> 22:18.359
There is. The Ministry of Rites

22:18.960 --> 22:21.339
finalizes the ranking list
of the metropolitan exam.

22:21.359 --> 22:23.379
As per the rules,

22:23.399 --> 22:26.299
the Imperial Inspectorate should review
the ranking list before the announcement.

22:26.319 --> 22:28.099
Mr. Chen can review it.

22:28.119 --> 22:30.439
He asked me to deliver this
to Mr. Fan.

22:31.480 --> 22:33.059
You are so fatuous.

22:33.079 --> 22:34.919
Just let Mr. Fan sleep more,

22:34.919 --> 22:37.520
and we can eat more. Isn't that better?

22:38.559 --> 22:40.200
Come on.

22:40.280 --> 22:42.320
Try this.

22:43.280 --> 22:44.480
Let me taste it first.

22:48.200 --> 22:48.960
Nice.

22:48.960 --> 22:50.320
Try this.

22:54.079 --> 22:55.240
How does it taste?

22:55.520 --> 22:57.280
It's a very special flavor.

22:57.440 --> 22:58.760
What is this?

22:59.200 --> 23:00.720
Yogurt.

23:04.879 --> 23:06.119
You are awake, Mr. Fan.

23:13.919 --> 23:14.660
It's fine.

23:14.680 --> 23:15.839
Keep eating.

23:17.000 --> 23:18.480
What are you looking at me?

23:18.639 --> 23:19.839
Wang, stop pretending.

23:19.839 --> 23:22.030
You haven't wiped off the yogurt
around your mouth.

23:25.240 --> 23:26.650
Mr. Fan, what is yogurt?

23:26.670 --> 23:28.070
What do you come here for?

23:29.800 --> 23:32.240
This is the ranking list
of the metropolitan exam.

23:32.320 --> 23:33.960
Mr. Chen asked me to send it over.

23:35.599 --> 23:36.919
Continue eating.

23:38.599 --> 23:40.679
If so, I will go
and look for my chopsticks.

23:48.960 --> 23:50.960
Well, you can continue.

23:59.520 --> 24:00.720
What's wrong, Mr. Fan?

24:02.159 --> 24:03.599
Yang Wanli failed.

24:04.079 --> 24:06.119
His name isn't on the list.

24:06.359 --> 24:07.960
Could it be that he made mistakes?

24:10.359 --> 24:13.000
Wang, let's go to the Ministry of Rites
after eating.

24:17.280 --> 24:18.360
I'm not eating.

24:25.240 --> 24:27.159
Will you stop pacing?

24:29.040 --> 24:30.120
Mr. Fan.

24:33.000 --> 24:33.740
How is it?

24:33.760 --> 24:35.520
I looked through the answer sheets.

24:37.040 --> 24:40.170
Yang Wanli's paper
is among the other passed papers.

24:40.190 --> 24:41.700
Isn't it supposed to be anonymous?

24:41.720 --> 24:43.660
I saw him writing
the political discourse.

24:43.680 --> 24:45.000
I remember his answer.

24:45.760 --> 24:49.700
Did someone miss his name
while copying the finalized list?

24:49.720 --> 24:50.800
No.

24:52.079 --> 24:54.560
Yang Wanli's answer sheet

24:54.720 --> 24:56.399
is changed to someone else's name.

25:01.475 --> 25:03.600
[Spring Metropolitan Exam]

25:03.601 --> 25:06.245
[Sheng Huaiyuan
of Hedong Circuit in Weizhou]

25:19.680 --> 25:21.359
Is it so difficult

25:21.639 --> 25:22.960
to be fair?

25:23.000 --> 25:24.480
We must look into this, Mr. Fan.

25:24.559 --> 25:26.700
Let's find out who replaced Yang Wanli.

25:26.720 --> 25:27.740
No need for that.

25:27.760 --> 25:29.079
I recognize this name.

25:29.639 --> 25:30.719
You do?

25:31.040 --> 25:34.119
[Sheng Huaiyuan of Hedong Circuit]
Pay attention to these names.

25:34.440 --> 25:36.060
What do you want me to do,
Your Highness?

25:36.080 --> 25:37.940
Do nothing
during the anonymous transcription.

25:37.960 --> 25:39.119
That's all I need.

25:40.159 --> 25:42.960
The name replacing Yang Wanli
is one of those names.

25:43.000 --> 25:44.800
The Crown Prince's disciple?

25:47.399 --> 25:48.410
If I may, Mr. Fan,

25:48.430 --> 25:50.339
are the rest of the names admitted
besides this one?

25:50.359 --> 25:51.520
Just him.

25:51.559 --> 25:52.119
Aside from that,

25:52.119 --> 25:53.760
the ranking is normal.

25:55.000 --> 25:56.080
Mr. Fan,

25:56.280 --> 25:57.819
you must think carefully.

25:57.839 --> 25:59.500
The Second Prince and you
have had a beef now.

25:59.520 --> 26:01.899
If you were to offend the Crown Prince,

26:01.919 --> 26:02.899
you must think this through.

26:02.919 --> 26:04.040
No need.

26:04.359 --> 26:05.220
I keep good

26:05.240 --> 26:06.379
on my word.

26:06.399 --> 26:07.420
What word?

26:07.440 --> 26:08.720
This spring exam

26:09.119 --> 26:10.240
must be clean.

26:10.639 --> 26:11.339
Deng,

26:11.359 --> 26:13.260
summon the First Division
to besiege this place.

26:13.280 --> 26:14.020
Without my order,

26:14.040 --> 26:15.720
no one will announce the results.

26:17.200 --> 26:18.280
Yes.

26:18.520 --> 26:19.299
Wang Qinian.

26:19.319 --> 26:19.980
At your service.

26:20.000 --> 26:21.630
Let's go to the Eastern Palace.

26:44.520 --> 26:46.960
Your Highness,
Mr. Fan shows up unannounced.

26:47.950 --> 26:49.560
Why didn't you inform me sooner?

26:49.960 --> 26:51.320
Hurry and put them away.

26:51.839 --> 26:53.539
The tailored garments you requested
are done.

26:53.559 --> 26:54.940
They are on the way here.

26:54.960 --> 26:55.930
Who arranged that?

26:55.950 --> 26:57.630
You arranged it, Your Highness.

27:10.879 --> 27:12.240
Mr. Fan,

27:12.639 --> 27:14.819
what brings you here in such a hurry?

27:14.839 --> 27:16.240
Please come this way.

27:22.159 --> 27:24.839
So, this is why you are here.

27:34.200 --> 27:35.220
What are those?

27:35.240 --> 27:36.679
I prepared these for you.

27:37.159 --> 27:38.439
Which one do you like?

27:39.280 --> 27:40.839
I don't know much about these.

27:40.919 --> 27:42.379
Which tailor store creates these?

27:42.399 --> 27:43.479
I created them.

27:44.280 --> 27:45.360
Your Highness?

27:46.010 --> 27:47.240
I casually drew them

27:47.480 --> 27:49.000
and had a tailor make them.

27:51.440 --> 27:53.119
You are a designer.

27:54.720 --> 27:55.780
Pardon?

27:55.800 --> 27:56.880
Never mind.

27:56.919 --> 27:58.539
But why are their faces covered?

27:58.559 --> 27:59.579
Their looks

27:59.599 --> 28:01.079
don't match with the clothes.

28:02.839 --> 28:03.919
I got it.

28:04.280 --> 28:07.280
Who are these clothes made for?

28:15.870 --> 28:16.890
No one in particular.

28:16.910 --> 28:18.240
I created these for fun.

28:18.319 --> 28:20.059
The designs are refined.
It doesn't seem so.

28:20.079 --> 28:21.560
That's what I like about you.

28:21.680 --> 28:22.819
If it were others,

28:22.839 --> 28:25.359
they probably would advise me
to focus on state affairs.

28:26.319 --> 28:28.679
One should have a hobby, after all.

28:33.420 --> 28:34.599
By the way,

28:35.599 --> 28:36.960
the substituted name

28:37.079 --> 28:38.720
on the spring exam ranking list

28:39.760 --> 28:41.240
is my protege.

28:41.599 --> 28:43.679
But if I said I had nothing
to do with this,

28:43.950 --> 28:45.139
would you believe me?

28:45.159 --> 28:46.240
Of course.

28:46.440 --> 28:47.780
If it were you,

28:47.800 --> 28:49.920
you wouldn't have just replaced
only one name

28:50.159 --> 28:52.099
nor would you ditch Yang Wanli out.

28:52.119 --> 28:53.740
Obviously, someone tried to pit us

28:53.760 --> 28:55.040
against each other.

28:55.480 --> 28:56.679
Sound judgment.

28:57.630 --> 28:58.919
Fan Xian laid siege to the exam hall?

28:58.919 --> 28:59.910
This news shocked the entire city.

28:59.919 --> 29:00.359
Then?

29:00.359 --> 29:02.400
Then, he headed straight
to the Eastern Palace.

29:04.240 --> 29:06.299
Was the Crown Prince behind this,
perchance?

29:06.319 --> 29:07.700
He isn't that clueless.

29:07.720 --> 29:08.440
This is strange.

29:08.440 --> 29:11.220
His Majesty has already given the order.
Who would tamper with the spring exam?

29:11.240 --> 29:12.099
Who else could it be

29:12.119 --> 29:13.399
besides Chengze?

29:14.359 --> 29:15.740
This is not like him.

29:15.760 --> 29:16.960
This is rather blunt.

29:17.960 --> 29:20.079
We can take time to look into this.

29:20.319 --> 29:22.919
But the priority now is
how to wrap this up.

29:27.079 --> 29:28.460
After all, my protege got involved.

29:28.480 --> 29:29.919
Why don't we just let it be?

29:30.390 --> 29:31.560
Here's what I will do.

29:31.599 --> 29:32.819
I will ensure Yang Wanli

29:32.839 --> 29:34.700
becomes an official within a year.

29:34.720 --> 29:35.579
What do you say?

29:35.599 --> 29:36.780
What if one day

29:36.800 --> 29:39.020
someone accuses you

29:39.040 --> 29:40.690
of the spring exam corruption
to His Majesty?

29:40.710 --> 29:42.440
Could you imagine the repercussions?

29:43.839 --> 29:45.520
We mustn't let this happen.

29:45.950 --> 29:47.679
You always have excellent foresight.

29:48.399 --> 29:50.139
We simply can't tolerate this.

29:50.159 --> 29:50.960
Not only that,

29:50.980 --> 29:52.060
but we must also make a scene of it.

29:52.079 --> 29:53.159
How?

29:53.320 --> 29:55.160
To alert the Imperial Inspectorate?

29:55.960 --> 29:57.879
The spring exam hall

29:58.240 --> 30:00.119
is under the Ministry of Rites.

30:00.800 --> 30:02.059
How dare you surround this place.

30:02.079 --> 30:05.130
Who should be held accountable
if tomorrow's result announcement is delayed?

30:07.350 --> 30:09.579
Deng Ziyue of the First Division
of the Imperial Inspectorate

30:09.599 --> 30:11.160
will bear the responsibility.

30:12.280 --> 30:13.760
Since when

30:15.079 --> 30:16.800
does the Imperial Inspectorate
trample upon

30:16.800 --> 30:18.599
the etiquette and protocol?

30:21.150 --> 30:22.579
Be mindful of the cruel edge.

30:22.599 --> 30:24.819
Please don't be reckless, Mr. Guo.

30:24.839 --> 30:27.200
I would like to see

30:28.000 --> 30:29.560
how cruel your blade can be.

30:36.800 --> 30:38.000
Fellow peers,

30:38.240 --> 30:40.339
the First Division has always
followed the ethical rules

30:40.359 --> 30:41.940
and understood customary diplomacy.

30:41.960 --> 30:43.619
However, does the Imperial Inspectorate

30:43.639 --> 30:46.280
need to know that?

30:48.319 --> 30:50.040
The blades in our hands

30:51.319 --> 30:52.839
are here for a reason.

31:00.000 --> 31:01.560
I would like to see

31:01.800 --> 31:03.159
how you end this.

31:17.599 --> 31:18.720
Fellow peers,

31:20.119 --> 31:24.439
Mr. Fan sealed the exam hall off
for the sake of the candidates,

31:24.520 --> 31:26.639
which has rarely happened since before.

31:26.919 --> 31:28.839
Everything he has said is true.

31:29.559 --> 31:32.639
Before this, I had been muddling along

31:32.680 --> 31:34.079
with my life.

31:34.319 --> 31:35.599
I admit

31:35.960 --> 31:37.560
that I threw all my senses away.

31:39.480 --> 31:41.639
After Mr. Fan's arrival,

31:42.350 --> 31:44.000
the First Division has changed.

31:45.000 --> 31:46.240
I believe

31:46.399 --> 31:48.539
it will eventually resume its duty

31:48.559 --> 31:50.520
to monitor all officials

31:50.680 --> 31:52.619
and deter corrupt evils.

31:52.639 --> 31:54.000
To that end,

31:54.520 --> 31:57.079
I vow to follow Mr. Fan for life.

31:57.280 --> 31:59.040
Fellow peers,

32:00.000 --> 32:03.439
do honor the uniform you wear

32:03.480 --> 32:05.240
and the Qing State!

32:05.639 --> 32:07.200
For the sake of the Qing State!

32:08.950 --> 32:10.720
Seek an audience with the Emperor?

32:10.919 --> 32:12.660
Mr. Fan and the Crown Prince, you mean?

32:12.680 --> 32:13.839
Precisely.

32:14.919 --> 32:15.480
What for?

32:15.480 --> 32:17.280
From what I heard,
it's about the spring exam corruption.

32:17.280 --> 32:18.780
The spring exam of this year?

32:19.119 --> 32:21.280
Mr. Fan had the exam hall besieged.

32:21.680 --> 32:23.859
How did you know
about something like that?

32:23.879 --> 32:25.780
The news is making the rounds
in the streets,

32:25.800 --> 32:26.480
saying that Mr. Fan

32:26.480 --> 32:28.720
seeks justice for all the candidates.

32:29.000 --> 32:30.439
As expected of him.

32:32.079 --> 32:34.220
But how come you always
get wind of street rumors?

32:34.240 --> 32:35.679
I have never heard of any.

32:35.760 --> 32:37.139
Street rumors?

32:37.159 --> 32:38.260
Who spread that?

32:38.280 --> 32:39.660
It's from the street,

32:39.680 --> 32:40.839
so, who knows?

32:41.760 --> 32:43.819
The spring exam corruption is serious,

32:43.839 --> 32:45.720
yet rumors are spreading around so soon.

32:46.119 --> 32:48.500
This doesn't make sense.

32:48.520 --> 32:50.399
Perhaps Mr. Fan spread it himself

32:50.879 --> 32:52.440
to use public opinion as leverage.

32:52.450 --> 32:53.310
That's reasonable.

32:53.330 --> 32:54.720
If it wasn't
for the Imperial Inspectorate,

32:54.720 --> 32:56.059
the news wouldn't have traveled so fast.

32:56.079 --> 32:57.240
If that's the case,

32:57.520 --> 32:59.320
he could only move forward

32:59.720 --> 33:01.000
with no turning back.

33:01.800 --> 33:03.240
Somehow, I feel

33:03.960 --> 33:05.790
that something is pushing him forward

33:07.319 --> 33:09.859
with each step planned.

33:09.879 --> 33:10.980
Who did that?

33:11.000 --> 33:12.080
For what purpose?

33:13.079 --> 33:14.599
The plot thickens.

33:15.919 --> 33:17.399
I can't see through it.

33:22.200 --> 33:23.379
Where is Eunuch Hou?

33:23.399 --> 33:25.330
Mr. Fan, he is serving for His Majesty.

33:25.350 --> 33:26.500
May I know your name?

33:26.520 --> 33:27.819
Please don't be courteous.

33:27.839 --> 33:29.099
I'm Hong Zhu.

33:29.119 --> 33:31.000
Acting in Eunuch Hou's place
at such a young age,

33:31.000 --> 33:32.720
you surely have a promising future.

33:32.960 --> 33:35.260
It's all thanks to Eunuch Dai
of the Crop Inspection Bureau.

33:35.280 --> 33:36.680
Crop Inspection Bureau?

33:36.760 --> 33:39.579
It's that Eunuch Dai who bribed you
with 3,000 taels.

33:39.599 --> 33:41.139
He committed a serious crime,

33:41.159 --> 33:42.300
and when he was asked

33:42.320 --> 33:44.420
for someone to take over
the Crop Inspection Bureau,

33:44.440 --> 33:46.180
he stated my name.

33:46.200 --> 33:47.280
Hold on.

33:51.680 --> 33:53.500
How are you two related?

33:53.520 --> 33:55.780
Your Highness,
we are not related in any way.

33:55.800 --> 33:58.200
I only helped him pick up his shoe once.

33:59.319 --> 34:00.839
In that case,

34:01.079 --> 34:02.439
you should blame me.

34:02.639 --> 34:03.700
Instead, I should thank you.

34:03.720 --> 34:04.579
For what?

34:04.599 --> 34:06.260
If Eunuch Dai hadn't collapsed,

34:06.280 --> 34:08.720
I wouldn't have had the opportunity
to take over the bureau,

34:08.839 --> 34:10.620
and nor would I have been noticed

34:10.640 --> 34:13.019
by Eunuch Hou afterward.

34:13.039 --> 34:15.999
All in all, I'm indebted to you,
Mr. Fan.

34:19.200 --> 34:20.620
Hasn't anyone advised you

34:20.640 --> 34:21.540
not to be so outspoken

34:21.560 --> 34:22.999
in the palace?

34:23.160 --> 34:25.140
Mr. Fan, you possess shocking talent,

34:25.160 --> 34:27.899
and now you enter the palace
to stand up for the candidates.

34:27.919 --> 34:29.819
I admire you so much

34:29.839 --> 34:31.439
that I can't contain myself.

34:35.800 --> 34:36.359
How did you know

34:36.359 --> 34:38.200
I came here for the candidates?

34:42.039 --> 34:43.580
Mr. Fan, every word and action of yours

34:43.600 --> 34:44.660
has been spread widely.

34:44.680 --> 34:45.939
Has been spread widely?

34:45.959 --> 34:47.090
The entire capital knows.

34:47.110 --> 34:48.839
Everyone is greatly impressed.

34:50.919 --> 34:53.800
Did you deliberately spread the news?

34:54.120 --> 34:55.600
Clever play.

35:02.479 --> 35:03.559
Nothing.

35:03.720 --> 35:04.800
Show us the way.

35:16.919 --> 35:17.979
Your Majesty,

35:17.999 --> 35:19.220
the Crown Prince

35:19.240 --> 35:20.999
and Fan Xian request an audience.

35:51.200 --> 35:51.939
Father.

35:51.959 --> 35:52.399
Your Majesty.

35:52.400 --> 35:53.940
- I offer my greetings.
- I offer my greetings.

35:53.960 --> 35:55.879
- Greetings, Mr. Chen.
- Greetings, Mr. Chen.

36:01.760 --> 36:02.839
Your Majesty, Mr. Chen,

36:02.839 --> 36:04.339
if you are in the middle
of a discussion,

36:04.359 --> 36:05.340
I can excuse myself.

36:05.360 --> 36:06.940
We aren't discussing anything.

36:06.960 --> 36:08.450
I delivered something here.

36:20.640 --> 36:21.720
Your Majesty,

36:23.039 --> 36:26.320
Fan Xian has an important matter
to report.

36:27.319 --> 36:28.200
Then,

36:28.200 --> 36:29.559
what are you doing here?

36:30.680 --> 36:34.260
Well, it concerns me.

36:34.280 --> 36:35.879
Speak.

36:37.640 --> 36:38.720
Yes, Father.

36:39.519 --> 36:42.080
Someone tampered
with the spring exam ranking list

36:42.310 --> 36:44.120
and substituted a passed candidate

36:44.200 --> 36:45.479
with my protege.

36:45.479 --> 36:47.260
The spring exam corruption
is of great significance.

36:47.260 --> 36:49.780
Someone has distinctly framed me.

36:49.800 --> 36:51.240
I feel aggrieved.

36:51.479 --> 36:52.899
Hence, I reckon

36:52.919 --> 36:55.080
this must be investigated thoroughly.

36:58.560 --> 36:59.800
What do you think?

37:01.399 --> 37:04.839
Your Majesty, I think this is absurd.

37:06.080 --> 37:07.160
Fan Xian,

37:07.640 --> 37:09.939
are you responsible
for supervising the spring exam?

37:09.959 --> 37:11.100
Yes, it's my responsibility.

37:11.120 --> 37:13.830
If so, you should accomplish it well.

37:13.850 --> 37:15.459
The First Division has sealed off
the exam hall,

37:15.479 --> 37:17.299
and the ranking list
will be rectified as well.

37:17.319 --> 37:19.580
As for the mastermind
behind the corruption,

37:19.600 --> 37:21.150
should I get to the bottom of it?

37:23.600 --> 37:24.999
What do you two think?

37:27.600 --> 37:29.600
The spring exam holds great significance
for the state.

37:29.600 --> 37:30.879
I reckon

37:30.999 --> 37:31.780
we should.

37:31.800 --> 37:32.830
Go on, then.

37:32.850 --> 37:33.740
Who will take charge of it?

37:33.760 --> 37:35.120
Young people.

37:37.519 --> 37:39.680
You should take matters
into your own hands.

37:39.879 --> 37:42.120
How deeply and impartially
should we look into it?

37:49.200 --> 37:50.439
These are

37:51.439 --> 37:56.919
spring exam corruption reports
over the five years,

37:58.439 --> 38:00.019
which remain unsolved.

38:00.039 --> 38:00.939
Why is that so?

38:00.959 --> 38:02.379
Sweeping the problem

38:02.399 --> 38:03.979
under the carpet.

38:03.999 --> 38:05.840
No one dares to investigate the cases

38:06.200 --> 38:08.439
because the results

38:09.039 --> 38:10.479
would involve many parties.

38:10.919 --> 38:13.120
How deeply,

38:14.039 --> 38:15.899
impartially,

38:15.919 --> 38:17.800
or strictly the investigation should be

38:19.039 --> 38:20.399
is terrifying to answer.

38:21.039 --> 38:23.899
No one has mustered the courage
to investigate thus far.

38:23.919 --> 38:25.919
I'm brazen, Your Majesty.

38:34.280 --> 38:36.640
You? You want to take the case?

38:39.160 --> 38:41.419
Are you able to handle

38:41.439 --> 38:42.979
the result of the investigation?

38:42.999 --> 38:44.800
I will bear it myself.

38:48.359 --> 38:49.519
Look carefully.

38:50.280 --> 38:52.760
There are so many of them.

38:52.919 --> 38:55.839
I shall never retreat
from preserving a clean governance.

39:02.959 --> 39:04.039
You will do it.

39:42.090 --> 39:44.379
Understandably, you are taking cases
that happened this year,

39:44.399 --> 39:46.680
but why did you take those
from the past years?

39:46.720 --> 39:48.479
To show my loyalty.

39:50.280 --> 39:52.240
I can't back off, Your Highness.

39:52.760 --> 39:53.959
I have brought myself to this point

39:53.959 --> 39:55.270
and news about me has been circulating.

39:55.280 --> 39:56.220
I have no turning back.

39:56.240 --> 39:57.540
Are you suggesting

39:57.560 --> 39:59.499
that His Majesty and Mr. Chen
press you on this?

39:59.519 --> 40:00.879
Exactly.

40:02.919 --> 40:03.690
This is a tough job.

40:03.710 --> 40:05.250
You might offend many people.

40:05.839 --> 40:07.519
I have been long out of favor.

40:09.280 --> 40:10.439
I feel bad for you.

40:16.640 --> 40:17.819
Mother summons me.

40:17.839 --> 40:18.780
You may leave first.

40:18.800 --> 40:19.880
All right.

40:31.080 --> 40:33.080
Thank you for your reminder.

40:34.680 --> 40:36.120
May I have a word?

40:36.359 --> 40:37.520
Please.

40:47.880 --> 40:49.120
What's the matter?

40:59.479 --> 41:01.120
What is this?

41:05.359 --> 41:07.280
My previous surname is Chen.

41:07.760 --> 41:09.399
I originated from Yingzhou.

41:09.600 --> 41:11.240
A corrupt official

41:11.439 --> 41:12.620
seized my property

41:12.640 --> 41:14.080
and killed my clan.

41:14.839 --> 41:17.060
I was fortunate to run away,

41:17.080 --> 41:18.600
but with nowhere to turn to,

41:18.919 --> 41:20.260
so I entered the palace.

41:20.290 --> 41:21.299
Who is that corrupt official?

41:21.319 --> 41:23.600
The current governor of Yingzhou.

41:23.640 --> 41:25.479
Governor of Yingzhou.

41:25.640 --> 41:27.620
Savior, you promoted
the corruption investigation.

41:27.640 --> 41:30.140
The villain's assets were confiscated,
and he has been imprisoned,

41:30.160 --> 41:31.999
and sentenced to execution.

41:38.200 --> 41:42.200
If it weren't for you upholding justice,

41:42.640 --> 41:44.399
the death of my clan

41:45.399 --> 41:46.880
wouldn't have been avenged.

41:50.919 --> 41:53.080
Mr. Chen came up with the name list,

41:53.710 --> 41:55.940
and the Imperial Procuratorate
handled the case.

41:56.319 --> 41:57.819
Why thank me?

41:57.839 --> 41:59.499
I may be dull,

41:59.519 --> 42:00.760
but I know

42:00.999 --> 42:03.200
you started all this, savior.

42:12.519 --> 42:13.599
No need to bow.

42:18.150 --> 42:19.680
Does anyone in the palace know

42:20.200 --> 42:21.859
about your true identity?

42:21.879 --> 42:23.140
When I entered the palace,

42:23.160 --> 42:24.630
my hometown was registered

42:24.879 --> 42:26.600
as Jiaozhou.

42:27.720 --> 42:29.680
Here, I'm acknowledged
with the surname Hong.

42:30.039 --> 42:31.999
No one is aware of my deceased clan.

42:32.160 --> 42:33.640
Why the surname Hong?

42:33.680 --> 42:36.620
When I first came in here,
an old eunuch surnamed Hong

42:36.640 --> 42:38.240
looked after me very much.

42:38.399 --> 42:40.120
So I took his surname.

42:48.359 --> 42:50.800
Stop calling me savior.

42:51.039 --> 42:52.120
Understood,

42:52.680 --> 42:53.760
Mr. Fan.

42:57.440 --> 42:58.919
What did you understand?

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
